      {
        "id": "B001",
        "text": "check_type returns the original value when lists and dictionaries satisfy their parameterized element, key, and value types, including dict[str, list[int]]."
      },
      {
        "id": "B002",
        "text": "check_type accepts None for Optional[int] and values matching any Union member, but raises TypeCheckError when a non-member value such as a string is checked against Optional[int]."
      },
      {
        "id": "B003",
        "text": "CollectionCheckStrategy.FIRST_ITEM may accept a heterogeneous collection after checking only its first item, whereas ALL_ITEMS checks every item and raises TypeCheckError on a later mismatch."
